<Page path="/rules" eyebrow="conversation rules" title="be kind. disagree well." description="the few rules for comments on bosley.">
  <p>anonymity is here to protect people, not to hurt them. comments that break these rules are removed.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>no threats, harassment, or hate aimed at people for who they are.</li>
    <li>no one's private information — addresses, numbers, documents.</li>
    <li>no spam, scams, or advertising.</li>
    <li>nothing illegal, and nothing sexual involving minors, ever. that is reported to the authorities.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>comments are plain text only, up to 1,000 characters and two links. to report something, write to <a href="mailto:asher@bosley.app">asher@bosley.app</a> with the post and roughly what was said.</p>
</Page>
